'''LE-12''' was an older-model [[LE-series droid]]<ref name="Databank" /> who resided on the ''[[Colossus]]''.<ref name="Descent" /> It moved on two springy legs, and regularly performed tasks for [[Technician|mechanics]] and [[Scavenger|salvagers]] who resided on the platform. It was aided in these tasks by its two clamps and a head capable of rotating 360 degrees.<ref name="Databank" />

